    "detailed_description": "This is a fascinating VR leisure game, a game with giant catwoman is about to begin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875120/extras/1.JPG?t=1729734352\" /></span><br><br>A evil company created a huge cat woman and put it into the villain. This huge catwoman brought an unknown impact on the city. The game has a total of 3 carefully designed levels, and each level provides players with a special gaming experience. You can randomly select the level to play the game. Each level has a unique game way and challenge waiting for you. Each level has a detailed explanation. Players can control the game operation by controlling the handle and gradually complete the customs clearance to achieve the game victory.<br>The intense and exciting background music will add a wonderful atmosphere to the game, so that you are immersed in the world of the game. Are you ready to meet the challenge? Come and challenge together!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875120/extras/2.JPG?t=1729734352\" /></span><br><br>Operation method:<br>Move Forward/Backward \uff1aL/R-handle up/down<br>Turn \uff1aL/R-handle left/right<br>Quit : Menu key<br>Reset : L/R-handle grip<br><br>Level 1<br>Press handle trigger button to take a photo when approaching the catgirl, complete 10 times<br>Take shot \uff1aL/R handle trigger <br>Fly up \uff1aLeft handle up <br>Fly down \uff1aLeft handle down <br>Fly left \uff1aLeft handle left <br>Fly right \uff1a Left handle right <br><br>Level 2<br>Fly around the aperture, do not deviate too far, complete 3 times.<br>Fly up \uff1aLeft handle up<br>Fly down \uff1aLeft handle down<br>Fly left \uff1aLeft handle left<br>Fly right \uff1aLeft handle right<br><br>Level 3<br>Catgirl roam around the country of Lilliputians and trample on many of them. Hurry up and save the country of Lilliputians.<br>Fire \uff1a Right handle trigger<br>Boost \uff1aRight handle up<br>Break \uff1aRight handle down",
